{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-database-as-a-service","title":"图数据库即服务：Neptune、Cosmos DB 与 AuraDB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/platforms/graph-database-as-a-service","wordCount":1209,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"图数据库即服务-neptune-cosmos-db-与-auradb\">图数据库即服务：Neptune、Cosmos DB 与 AuraDB</h1><p>云托管的图数据库服务（GDBaaS）消除了运维负担，让团队专注于业务逻辑。主要云厂商都提供了图数据库托管服务，各有不同的技术路线和适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon Neptune</td>\n<td>AWS 全托管图数据库，同时支持 LPG（openCypher/Gremlin）和 RDF（SPARQL）双引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neptune Serverless</td>\n<td>Neptune 的自动扩缩容版本，按 NCU-秒计费，空闲时接近零成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neptune Analytics</td>\n<td>Neptune 针对图分析的专项服务，全内存存储，内置图算法库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure Cosmos DB Gremlin</td>\n<td>Azure 的 TinkerPop 兼容图服务，原生多区域，需要分区键设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neo4j AuraDB</td>\n<td>Neo4j 官方云服务，保留完整 Cypher/GDS/APOC 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NCU（Neptune Capacity Unit）</td>\n<td>Neptune Serverless 的计量单位，1 NCU 约 0.5 GB RAM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"amazon-neptune\">Amazon Neptune</h2><p>Amazon Neptune 是 AWS 的全托管图数据库服务，是目前功能最完整、生产验证最充分的云图数据库服务之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"技术架构\">技术架构</h3><p>Neptune 采用与 Aurora 相同的<strong>分离计算存储架构</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Client[应用层] --&gt; LB[负载均衡器]&#10;    LB --&gt; Writer[写节点\\nPrimary]&#10;    LB --&gt; Reader1[只读节点 1\\nReplica]&#10;    LB --&gt; Reader2[只读节点 2\\nReplica]&#10;    Writer --&gt; Storage[分布式存储层\\n6份副本跨3个AZ]&#10;    Reader1 --&gt; Storage&#10;    Reader2 --&gt; Storage\">graph TD\n    Client[应用层] --&gt; LB[负载均衡器]\n    LB --&gt; Writer[写节点\\nPrimary]\n    LB --&gt; Reader1[只读节点 1\\nReplica]\n    LB --&gt; Reader2[只读节点 2\\nReplica]\n    Writer --&gt; Storage[分布式存储层\\n6份副本跨3个AZ]\n    Reader1 --&gt; Storage\n    Reader2 --&gt; Storage</pre><p>关键特性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双引擎</strong>：同一实例同时支持 <strong>openCypher/Gremlin</strong>（LPG）和 <strong>SPARQL</strong>（RDF）</li>\n<li><strong>存储自动扩展</strong>：按需自动增长，最大 128 TB</li>\n<li><strong>读副本</strong>：最多 15 个只读副本，支持跨可用区</li>\n<li><strong>高可用</strong>：存储跨 3 个 AZ 保存 6 份副本，实例故障自动故障转移（&lt; 30 秒）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"neptune-serverless\">Neptune Serverless</h3><p>2022 年发布的 Neptune Serverless 实现<strong>自动容量伸缩</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Neptune Capacity Units (NCU)：&#10;- 最小：1 NCU（0.5 GB RAM + 相应 CPU）&#10;- 最大：128 NCU（64 GB RAM）&#10;- 计费：按 NCU-秒计算，无流量时接近零成本\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Neptune Capacity Units (NCU)：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 最小：1 NCU（0.5 GB RAM + 相应 CPU）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 最大：128 NCU（64 GB RAM）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 计费：按 NCU-秒计算，无流量时接近零成本</span></span></code></pre></div><p>适合场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开发/测试环境（空闲时自动缩容到最小）</li>\n<li>间歇性负载（如批量分析作业）</li>\n<li>预算敏感的新项目（无需预置固定实例）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"连接与查询\">连接与查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Neptune 使用标准 openCypher/Gremlin 驱动&#10;# openCypher 连接&#10;from neo4j import GraphDatabase&#10;&#10;driver = GraphDatabase.driver(&#10;    &quot;bolt://your-neptune-endpoint:8182&quot;,&#10;    auth=(&quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;),  # Neptune 使用 IAM 认证，不是用户名密码&#10;    encrypted=True&#10;)&#10;&#10;# Gremlin 连接（使用 WebSocket）&#10;from gremlin_python.driver import client, serializer&#10;&#10;gremlin_client = client.Client(&#10;    &#39;wss://your-neptune-endpoint:8182/gremlin&#39;,&#10;    &#39;g&#39;,&#10;    message_serializer=serializer.GraphSONSerializersV2d0()&#10;)&#10;&#10;# SPARQL 查询（通过 HTTP）&#10;import requests&#10;response = requests.post(&#10;    &#39;https://your-neptune-endpoint:8182/sparql&#39;,&#10;    data={&#39;query&#39;: &#39;SELECT ?s WHERE { ?s a &lt;http://schema.org/Person&gt; } LIMIT 10&#39;},&#10;    headers={&#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/x-www-form-urlencoded&#39;}&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Neptune 使用标准 openCypher/Gremlin 驱动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># openCypher 连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neo4j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GraphDatabase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">driver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GraphDatabase.driver(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"bolt://your-neptune-endpoint:8182\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    auth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Neptune 使用 IAM 认证，不是用户名密码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    encrypted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Gremlin 连接（使用 WebSocket）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gremlin_python.driver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client, serializer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gremlin_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.Client(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'wss://your-neptune-endpoint:8182/gremlin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'g'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    message_serializer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">serializer.GraphSONSerializersV2d0()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SPARQL 查询（通过 HTTP）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests.post(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'https://your-neptune-endpoint:8182/sparql'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT ?s WHERE { ?s a &#x3C;http://schema.org/Person> } LIMIT 10'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"neptune-与-iam-集成\">Neptune 与 IAM 集成</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 使用 AWS SigV4 签名认证（推荐生产环境）&#10;import boto3&#10;from botocore.auth import SigV4Auth&#10;from botocore.awsrequest import AWSRequest&#10;&#10;session = boto3.Session()&#10;credentials = session.get_credentials()&#10;&#10;def signed_neptune_request(endpoint, query):&#10;    request = AWSRequest(&#10;        method=&#39;POST&#39;,&#10;        url=f&#39;https://{endpoint}:8182/openCypher&#39;,&#10;        data={&#39;query&#39;: query},&#10;        headers={&#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/x-www-form-urlencoded&#39;}&#10;    )&#10;    SigV4Auth(credentials, &#39;neptune-db&#39;, &#39;us-east-1&#39;).add_auth(request)&#10;    return requests.post(request.url, data=request.body, headers=dict(request.headers))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 AWS SigV4 签名认证（推荐生产环境）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> botocore.auth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SigV4Auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> botocore.awsrequest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AWSRequest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">session </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3.Session()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">credentials </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session.get_credentials()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> signed_neptune_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(endpoint, query):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    request </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AWSRequest(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:8182/openCypher'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: query},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SigV4Auth(credentials, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'neptune-db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'us-east-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).add_auth(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requests.post(request.url, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">request.body, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request.headers))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"neptune-analytics\">Neptune Analytics</h3><p>2023 年发布的 <strong>Neptune Analytics</strong> 是针对图分析的专项服务：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Neptune Database</th>\n<th>Neptune Analytics</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主要用途</td>\n<td>OLTP 事务处理</td>\n<td>OLAP 图分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据加载</td>\n<td>增量写入</td>\n<td>批量加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存存储</td>\n<td>磁盘为主，缓存辅助</td>\n<td>全内存（向量 + 图）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图算法</td>\n<td>有限（依赖 Gremlin）</td>\n<td>丰富内置算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询语言</td>\n<td>openCypher/Gremlin/SPARQL</td>\n<td>openCypher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模</td>\n<td>PB 级持久化</td>\n<td>TB 级内存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"azure-cosmos-db-for-apache-gremlin\">Azure Cosmos DB for Apache Gremlin</h2><p>微软 Cosmos DB 通过 API 兼容层支持 Gremlin，背后存储是 Cosmos DB 的文档/图混合存储引擎。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cosmos-db-图模型\">Cosmos DB 图模型</h3><p>Cosmos DB Gremlin API 使用 TinkerPop 兼容的数据模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"groovy\" data-code=\"// 使用标准 Gremlin 语法&#10;g.addV(&#39;person&#39;).property(&#39;id&#39;, &#39;alice&#39;).property(&#39;name&#39;, &#39;Alice&#39;).property(&#39;pk&#39;, &#39;partitionKey&#39;)&#10;g.addV(&#39;person&#39;).property(&#39;id&#39;, &#39;bob&#39;).property(&#39;name&#39;, &#39;Bob&#39;).property(&#39;pk&#39;, &#39;partitionKey&#39;)&#10;g.addE(&#39;knows&#39;).from(g.V(&#39;alice&#39;)).to(g.V(&#39;bob&#39;)).property(&#39;since&#39;, &#39;2020&#39;)&#10;&#10;// 查询&#10;g.V().hasLabel(&#39;person&#39;).has(&#39;name&#39;, &#39;Alice&#39;)&#10; .out(&#39;knows&#39;)&#10; .values(&#39;name&#39;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用标准 Gremlin 语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.addV('person').property('id', 'alice').property('name', 'Alice').property('pk', 'partitionKey')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.addV('person').property('id', 'bob').property('name', 'Bob').property('pk', 'partitionKey')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.addE('knows').from(g.V('alice')).to(g.V('bob')).property('since', '2020')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>g.V().hasLabel('person').has('name', 'Alice')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .out('knows')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .values('name')</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分区键设计\">分区键设计</h3><p>Cosmos DB 要求每个顶点有一个<strong>分区键（Partition Key）</strong>，这是影响性能的关键设计决策：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"分区键选择原则：&#10;1. 高基数（cardinality）：分区越多，并发越高&#10;2. 查询本地化：频繁连接的节点尽量在同一分区&#10;3. 均匀分布：避免某些分区过热&#10;&#10;常见方案：&#10;- 社交图：用 userId 的前缀 bucket（如 userId % 100 作为分区键）&#10;- 电商图：用 categoryId（保证商品图局部性）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>分区键选择原则：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 高基数（cardinality）：分区越多，并发越高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 查询本地化：频繁连接的节点尽量在同一分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 均匀分布：避免某些分区过热</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>常见方案：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 社交图：用 userId 的前缀 bucket（如 userId % 100 作为分区键）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 电商图：用 categoryId（保证商品图局部性）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cosmos-db-vs-neptune-对比\">Cosmos DB vs Neptune 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Azure Cosmos DB Gremlin</th>\n<th>Amazon Neptune</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图模型</td>\n<td>LPG（TinkerPop）</td>\n<td>LPG + RDF 双引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询语言</td>\n<td>Gremlin</td>\n<td>openCypher / Gremlin / SPARQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球分发</td>\n<td>原生多区域（Cosmos 核心特性）</td>\n<td>手动设置全球副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟承诺</td>\n<td>P99 &lt; 10ms（单区域）</td>\n<td>无明确 SLA 数字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计费模式</td>\n<td>RU（Request Unit，预置或 Serverless）</td>\n<td>实例小时 + 存储 + I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 Azure 生态集成</td>\n<td>深度集成（Azure Functions、Event Hub）</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图算法</td>\n<td>无内置</td>\n<td>有限内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟度</td>\n<td>中等（图能力较 Neptune 弱）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"neo4j-auradb-云托管的原生图数据库\">Neo4j AuraDB：云托管的原生图数据库</h2><p>AuraDB 将 Neo4j 以 SaaS 方式提供，保留了完整的 Cypher/GDS/APOC 生态：</p>\n<h3 id=\"auradb-层级对比\">AuraDB 层级对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>AuraDB Free</th>\n<th>AuraDB Professional</th>\n<th>AuraDB Enterprise</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点上限</td>\n<td>200K</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系上限</td>\n<td>400K</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>1 GB</td>\n<td>按需付费</td>\n<td>按需付费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GDS 支持</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>99.9%</td>\n<td>99.99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有链接</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>VPC Peering</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域</td>\n<td>1 个</td>\n<td>多个</td>\n<td>多个 + 自定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"auradb-最佳实践\">AuraDB 最佳实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- AuraDB 连接字符串格式&#10;bolt+s://xxxxxxxx.databases.neo4j.io:7687&#10;&#10;-- 批量加载时使用 APOC 避免单次事务过大&#10;CALL apoc.periodic.iterate(&#10;  &#39;CALL apoc.load.json(&quot;https://storage.example.com/data.json&quot;) YIELD value&#39;,&#10;  &#39;MERGE (n:Entity {id: value.id}) SET n += value.props&#39;,&#10;  {batchSize: 500, parallel: false}&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- AuraDB 连接字符串格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bolt+s://xxxxxxxx.databases.neo4j.io:7687</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 批量加载时使用 APOC 避免单次事务过大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL apoc.periodic.iterate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'CALL apoc.load.json(\"https://storage.example.com/data.json\") YIELD value',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'MERGE (n:Entity {id: value.id}) SET n += value.props',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {batchSize: 500, parallel: false}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"云图数据库选型决策树\">云图数据库选型决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[需要图数据库云服务?] --&gt; B{主要云平台?}&#10;    B --&gt;|AWS| C{需要 RDF/SPARQL?}&#10;    B --&gt;|Azure| D[Cosmos DB Gremlin\\n原生 Azure 集成]&#10;    B --&gt;|GCP| E[Neo4j AuraDB\\nGCP Marketplace]&#10;    B --&gt;|无限制| F{主要需求?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| G[Neptune\\n双引擎支持]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| H{需要图分析?}&#10;    H --&gt;|OLTP 为主| G&#10;    H --&gt;|OLAP 图分析| I[Neptune Analytics]&#10;    F --&gt;|Cypher+GDS 生态| J[Neo4j AuraDB]&#10;    F --&gt;|Gremlin 生态| K[Neptune 或 Cosmos DB]&#10;    F --&gt;|低成本 Serverless| L[Neptune Serverless]\">graph TD\n    A[需要图数据库云服务?] --&gt; B{主要云平台?}\n    B --&gt;|AWS| C{需要 RDF/SPARQL?}\n    B --&gt;|Azure| D[Cosmos DB Gremlin\\n原生 Azure 集成]\n    B --&gt;|GCP| E[Neo4j AuraDB\\nGCP Marketplace]\n    B --&gt;|无限制| F{主要需求?}\n    C --&gt;|是| G[Neptune\\n双引擎支持]\n    C --&gt;|否| H{需要图分析?}\n    H --&gt;|OLTP 为主| G\n    H --&gt;|OLAP 图分析| I[Neptune Analytics]\n    F --&gt;|Cypher+GDS 生态| J[Neo4j AuraDB]\n    F --&gt;|Gremlin 生态| K[Neptune 或 Cosmos DB]\n    F --&gt;|低成本 Serverless| L[Neptune Serverless]</pre><h2 id=\"成本对比-2024-年估算\">成本对比（2024 年估算）</h2><p>以中等规模场景（100M 节点，1B 边，500 QPS 读，50 QPS 写）为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务</th>\n<th>估算月成本</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Neptune db.r6g.2xlarge（1写+2读）</td>\n<td>~$3,000</td>\n<td>存储和 I/O 另计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neptune Serverless（50 NCU 峰值）</td>\n<td>~$1,500-2,500</td>\n<td>有空闲时段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AuraDB Professional</td>\n<td>~$2,000-4,000</td>\n<td>取决于实例规格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cosmos DB Gremlin</td>\n<td>~$2,500+</td>\n<td>取决于 RU 配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注：以上为粗略估算，实际成本因数据访问模式差异显著，建议使用各云厂商的成本计算器精确评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>云托管图数据库服务降低了图数据库的运维门槛，但各服务的技术特性差异显著。Amazon Neptune 以双引擎支持和 AWS 深度集成，成为 AWS 生态的首选；Neptune Analytics 补充了批量图分析能力。Azure Cosmos DB Gremlin 提供原生多区域分布，适合 Azure 生态中对全球延迟敏感的场景，但图能力相对较弱。Neo4j AuraDB 是希望保留完整 Neo4j 生态（GDS 算法库、APOC 扩展）的最简云化路径。云服务选型应综合考虑团队所在云厂商生态、查询语言偏好、图分析需求和成本预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式图数据库：自托管的 NebulaGraph 和 TigerGraph 方案</li>\n<li>图数据库对比：完整的多平台选型矩阵</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图数据库即服务：Neptune、Cosmos DB 与 AuraDB","id":"图数据库即服务-neptune-cosmos-db-与-auradb"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Amazon Neptune","id":"amazon-neptune"},{"level":3,"text":"技术架构","id":"技术架构"},{"level":3,"text":"Neptune Serverless","id":"neptune-serverless"},{"level":3,"text":"连接与查询","id":"连接与查询"},{"level":3,"text":"Neptune 与 IAM 集成","id":"neptune-与-iam-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"Neptune Analytics","id":"neptune-analytics"},{"level":2,"text":"Azure Cosmos DB for Apache Gremlin","id":"azure-cosmos-db-for-apache-gremlin"},{"level":3,"text":"Cosmos DB 图模型","id":"cosmos-db-图模型"},{"level":3,"text":"分区键设计","id":"分区键设计"},{"level":3,"text":"Cosmos DB vs Neptune 对比","id":"cosmos-db-vs-neptune-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Neo4j AuraDB：云托管的原生图数据库","id":"neo4j-auradb-云托管的原生图数据库"},{"level":3,"text":"AuraDB 层级对比","id":"auradb-层级对比"},{"level":3,"text":"AuraDB 最佳实践","id":"auradb-最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"云图数据库选型决策树","id":"云图数据库选型决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"成本对比（2024 年估算）","id":"成本对比-2024-年估算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式图数据库：NebulaGraph 与 TigerGraph","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/platforms/distributed-graph-databases"},"next":{"title":"图数据库平台选型：全面对比与决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/platforms/graph-db-comparison"}}